text	The issue cites no `path:line`, so I have no citations to check. Now the fix:
Bash	sed -i '' 's/npm instal shop/npm install shop/' README.md && cat README.md && git diff --stat; ls -a; cat package.json Makefile 2>/dev/null
text	The repository has no check command: it holds only `README.md`. The closest check is a search for other misspellings:
